<TeXmacs|2.1.5>

<style|article>

<\body>
  <section|A drawing>

  A drawing made with the graphics editor: lines, a polygon, a circle, an
  arc, a spline, arrows and labels.

  <center|<with|gr-mode|<tuple|edit|line>|gr-frame|<tuple|scale|1cm|<tuple|0.5gw|0.5gh>>|gr-geometry|<tuple|geometry|8cm|5cm|center>|<graphics||<line|<point|-3.5|-2>|<point|3.5|-2>>|<with|arrow-end|\<gtr\>|<line|<point|-3.5|-2>|<point|-3.5|2>>>|<with|color|blue|<cline|<point|-2|-1>|<point|-1|-1>|<point|-1.5|0>>>|<with|color|red|fill-color|pastel
  red|<carc|<point|1|0>|<point|2|1>|<point|3|0>>>|<arc|<point|-3|1>|<point|-2|1.5>|<point|-1|1>>|<with|color|dark
  green|<spline|<point|0|-1.5>|<point|0.5|1>|<point|1.5|-1>|<point|2.5|1.5>>>|<text-at|A|<point|-2|-1.4>>|<text-at|<math|x<rsup|2>>|<point|1.8|-1.7>>|<with|dash-style|10|<line|<point|-1|1.8>|<point|3|1.8>>>>>>

  The caption of the drawing follows it.

  <\big-figure|<with|gr-mode|<tuple|edit|line>|gr-frame|<tuple|scale|1cm|<tuple|0.5gw|0.5gh>>|gr-geometry|<tuple|geometry|4cm|2cm|center>|<graphics||<cline|<point|-1.5|-0.8>|<point|1.5|-0.8>|<point|1.5|0.8>|<point|-1.5|0.8>>|<line|<point|-1.5|-0.8>|<point|1.5|0.8>>>>>
    A rectangle and its diagonal.
  </big-figure>
</body>

